  episode starts    : ticks [9, 491]
  risk              : risk_source=oof calibrated=False min=0.0145 max=0.9585 mean=0.0785 distinct=203 first_valid_tick=9
                      Leakage-safe out-of-fold sigmoid scores: every window scored by a model that never trained on its temporal block. UNCALIBRATED (pools 5 folds).
  workload          : 40 healthcare tasks, Sprint-5 criticality

MAPPO (centralised training, decentralised execution)
  actors            : 10 x MLP(48 -> [128, 128] -> 4), separate=True
  centralised critic: MLP(489+10 -> [256, 256] -> 1)
  clip=0.2 value_clip=0.2 ent=0.02 vf=0.5
  gamma=0.999 lambda=0.95 epochs=4 minibatches=4
  lr_actor=0.0007 lr_critic=0.001 grad_clip=0.5
  device=cpu
  independence      : 10 independent actors (233,000 params total, 23,300 each), 1 centralised critic (194,049 params)

  episodes          : 600 (8 per PPO update = 75 updates)
  train start window: ticks [9, 491] (first 70% of the usable range; evaluate.py uses the rest)
  seed              : 20260818
